& [Handle]
  + exact profile request identity operation and SHA256 digest of normalized NativeLifecycleValidationRequest bytes
  + compact handle is a locator commitment only and grants no reconstruction authentication authorization or lifecycle authority

& [Entry]
  + exact profile handle complete retained typed request normalized request byte count and domain-separated entry digest
  + handle must recompile exactly from retained request
  + request may produce any Slice7 outcome because custody must not reinterpret semantic validity

& [Registry]
  + exact profile BTreeMap keyed by lowercase request digest entry count retained request byte total domain-separated root digest and fixed nonclaims
  + maximum eight entries maximum eight megabytes per normalized request and maximum sixty-four megabytes aggregate retained request bytes
  + registry transformation is immutable and returns a new value
  + exact duplicate digest registration refuses visibly and never overwrites

& [Operations]
  + new returns one validated empty registry
  + compile_handle bounds and normalizes one typed request then derives its exact handle
  + register validates the predecessor registry compiles and checks the handle inserts one new exact entry recomputes counts root and returns a validated successor
  + resolve validates the whole registry and supplied handle then returns the exact retained typed request
  + validate_from_custody resolves then delegates once to Slice7 and must equal direct validation

& [MachineBoundary]
  + all forms deny unknown fields and normalized JSON output is deterministic
  + key digest profile count byte root entry handle and request substitutions fail closed
  + equal inputs have byte-identical outputs and insertion order cannot change an equivalent registry

& [NonAuthority]
  + immutable in-process value is not a physical database persistence freshness or global uniqueness
  + retained lookup is not semantic reconstruction from hash
  + digest and registry coherence are not truth correctness safety authentication authorization signature passage permission or effect authority
  + no filesystem process network clock environment secret model provider remote or external effect operation

& [Acceptance]
  + exact valid and refused requests register resolve and retain direct Slice7 response equivalence
  + duplicate missing cross-registry malformed tampered oversized count byte and root cases refuse
  + measured fixture handle is materially smaller than its retained request
  + focused debug optimized release lint format evidence and diff gates pass

& [NonGoals]
